  "description": "Change of use from Use Class C3 (dwelling house) to Use Class C4 (HMO-house in multiple occupation) with associated amenity, cycle and refuse storage (RETROSPECTIVE).",
  "development_type": "Other change of use",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be retained in accordance with the following approved plans:\rER-01- PL01\rER-01- PL02\rLocation Plan\rFIRE STATEMENT\rSUDS Statement\rDESIGN AND ACCESS STATEMENT\rPLANNING STATEMENT\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 3 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "Within three months of this permission, details of a communal container for the recycling of waste shall be provided within the development in pursuance of the HMO hereby approved and in accordance with the London Borough of Enfield Household Recycling and Waste Planning Guidance for New Developments (February 2024). The facilities shall be provided in accordance with the approved details and maintained as such thereafter.\r\rReason: in the interests of amenity and the recycling of waste materials in support of the Boroughs waste reduction targets.\r\r"
  ],
